    <p>Run the following code with a loop using the test cases in the activity below:</p>

     <program interactive="activecode" language="python">
        <code>
value = int(input("Enter a number (-1 to stop): "))
while value != -1:
    if value == 7:
        print("lucky number!")
    else:
        print("You entered", value)

    # 3. Update the loop variable with new input!
    value = int(input("Enter a another number (-1 to stop): "))
print("Done!")
        </code>
        </program>

   <activity label="loop-test-cases">
    <title>Loop Test Plan</title>
      <statement><p>
          Run the code above following the test plan below. Fill in the actual output column of the table.
      </p> 
      <table>
      <title>Test Cases</title>
          <tabular>
             <row header="yes">
